---
title: GHOST — testing quality gates
---
%% Intended design; not runtime evidence
flowchart TD
  Edit["Current milestone change"] --> Static["Compile projects and inspect prohibited APIs"]
  Static --> Unit["Nonzero unit test discovery"]
  Unit --> Integration["Boundary storage and process tests"]
  Integration --> Native["Native fixture and physical input tests"]
  Native --> Access["Keyboard screen reader and visual checks"]
  Access --> Fault["Fault privacy and lifetime checks"]
  Fault --> Perf["Measured relevant performance"]
  Perf --> Evidence["Record exact setup and logs"]
  Evidence --> Pass{"Acceptance complete without P0?"}
  Pass -->|No| Repair["Fix or record blocked scope"]
  Repair --> Edit
  Pass -->|Yes| Review["Gate review"]
  Review --> Next["Next gate only when authorized"]
  Review --> Release{"Final release gate?"}
  Release -->|Yes| Clean["Offline clean-host installation and regression"]
